 * Current one-variant-per-product scope is intentional: a different mapped variant
 * needs a separately reviewed reader, never a guessed first-variant/SKU fallback.
 *
 * Required: FEED_IDENTITY_MAP (JSON, see validateIdentityMap below), existing Shopify
 * credentials. Optional: SCAN (bounded local read ceiling), OUT (candidate XML).
